    "title": "How Theology School Turned Me Into an Atheist",
    "video_id": "jZ7HNPihkBk"
   },
   {
    "context": "Beware. Truth should always lead to the grounds of God's self-revelation. Truth should always make you and I love God more. Be convicted and corrected by the Spirit of God, and be conformed to the image of his Son, Jesus the Christ. And in that regard, I want to say that the scripture is actually liberating.",
